==Strategy==
Bring [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] for the Bores and [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] like [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]], [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] and [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] for the Zombies. Once Bore dies, rush the backliners down with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

Alternatively, summon [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Cutter Cat]], who should kill both Sir Seals, then follow by rushing down the enemy base with the likes of [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and A. Bahamut before the Bores come out. If you plan to do this, you won't be needing much variety, so ensure you have your best Attack UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] active!

